<title>USA: GOLF-SCORES AT LPGA TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP AFTER SECOND ROUND.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SCORES AT LPGA TOUR CHAMPIONSHIP AFTER SECOND ROUND.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores at the</p>
<p>$700,000 LPGA Tour Championship after the second round Friday</p>
<p>on the par-72, 6,924-yard Desert Inn Golf Course (golfers U.S.</p>
<p>unless stated):</p>
<p>137 Emilee Klein 69 68</p>
<p>138 Juli Inkster 68 70</p>
<p>139 Laura Davies (Britain) 69 70, Karrie Webb (Australia) 69</p>
<p>70, Michelle McGann 68 71, Penny Hammel 68 71 </p>
<p>140 Kelly Robbins 70 70 </p>
<p>141 Nancy Lopez 73 68, Annika Sorenstam (Sweden) 73 68,</p>
<p>Brandie Burton 72 69</p>
